@Levi-zhan , 
for the `conv-exp` pattern in the pic that you show, I doubt that we can maintain the accuracy if we insert extra q/dq between `conv` and `exp`. 
for the `conv-sigmoid-*` pattern, if we change to `conv-sigmoid-q/dq-*`, there will dangling `dq` node cannot optimized away. you can do an experiment to check the time change.
